== Trivia ==
* Both the item itself and the description is a reflection of one of Isaac's nightmares between floors that involves him finding a razor blade inside a piece of candy.
* The item and pickup quote are a reference to the [[wikipedia:poisoned candy myths|urban legend]] of giving away candies with razor blades hidden inside of them as a way of harming people.

